<decision #track.refactor-progressive-context-resource-loading.d2 apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "pending" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = false } (
  <question ?>
Reuse and reload rule
  </?>
  <recommendation ?>
Reuse and reload rule
  </?>
  <evidence ?>
Legacy provenance: codument/tracks/archived/2026-07/2026-07-17-2132-refactor-progressive-context-resource-loading/decisions.md

- Final decision: Reuse only when the same content revision covers the requested fragment and its delivery remains fully visible in materialized provider context. Reload after revision change, removal, or compaction.
- Reason: Persisted observation alone does not mean the model still has the content.
- Status: confirmed
  </?>
)>

<decision #track.refactor-progressive-context-resource-loading.d3 apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "pending" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = false } (
